§ `s 3`

#ASSERT `is subject to military law` `a regular in service`
#ASSERT NOT `is subject to military law` `a discharged regular`
#ASSERT NOT `is subject to military law` `a youth whose liability has not yet arisen`
#ASSERT `is subject to military law` `a full-time NSman in service`
