#ASSERT NOT `is subject to military law` `an NSman at home between call-ups`
#ASSERT NOT `is subject to military law` `a defence civilian in peacetime`
#ASSERT `is subject to military law` `a defence civilian on active service`
#ASSERT `is subject to military law` `a reporter accompanying the SAF on active service`
